# ── Connect a dApp (WalletConnect WALLET role) ─────────────────────────────
# The in-app (local-login) wallet can act as a WalletConnect wallet so users
# can paste a wc: link from an external dApp and sign for it. Ethereum was
# added to the in-app wallet's chain registry for this (most dApps list
# eip155:1). Public RPC list with failover — set ETHEREUM_RPC_URL to use your
# own node. Both empty falls back to built-in public endpoints.
# ETHEREUM_RPC_URL=https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com
# ETHEREUM_RPC_FALLBACKS=https://eth.llamarpc.com,https://rpc.ankr.com/eth

# ── G$ Raffle (GoodMarketRaffle) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Round-based G$ raffle. 10 participants per round, 500 G$ entry, 4 winners
# paid 40/30/20/10 (2,000 / 1,500 / 1,000 / 500 G$). The pool pays out 100%,
# so the contract needs no funding and has no house edge.
#
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS - deployed raffle (empty = UI shows
#   "not deployed yet" and no participation is possible).
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_RANDOMNESS_KEY - keeper key. Its address MUST match the
#   randomnessProvider set at deploy time; whoever holds it chooses the draw
#   seed and can therefore influence the outcome. Use a non-incentivized key.
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_DEPLOYMENT_BLOCK - receipt block of the deploy (anchor for
#   any event scan).
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_DEPLOY_KEY - one-time deploy gas payer (no ongoing role).
#
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x...
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_DEPLOYMENT_BLOCK=...
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_RANDOMNESS_KEY=0x...
# GOODMARKET_RAFFLE_DEPLOY_KEY=0x...
